BIP-0039 English word list

name_words.txt is an unmodified copy of the 2,048-word English list from
Trezor's BIP-0039 reference implementation, python-mnemonic:
https://github.com/trezor/python-mnemonic/blob/b57a5ad77a981e743f4167ab2f7927a55c1e82a8/src/mnemonic/wordlist/english.txt

The contents are identical to the word list published with BIP-0039:
https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/ce1862ac6bcffa1dd20aad858380e51e66e949ea/bip-0039/english.txt

BIP-0039 authors: Marek Palatinus, Pavol Rusnak, Aaron Voisine, and Sean Bowe.
fwm uses these words solely to generate short, readable rule names.

